# Can we use UTF8 in regex?
Server init.
>> p := Iphethini okusha: ['\\w'].
Okuphumayo bhala: ( p ukufana: ['x'] ), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: ( p ukufana: ['é'] ), umugqa-omusha.
>> p := Iphethini okusha: ['(*UTF)(*UCP)\\w'].
Okuphumayo bhala: ( p ukufana: ['é'] ), umugqa-omusha.
# should give 101